<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose four points to 1,283.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose four points to 1,283.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,283 today from 1,279 on Aug 1, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1374    12.475	  1383    12.556</p>
<p>   1a   1259  9538.000	  1264  9575.000</p>
<p>   2    1590    22.719	  1582    22.594</p>
<p>   2a   1508 12369.000	  1510 12388.000</p>
<p>   3    1383    12.763	  1375    12.681</p>
<p>   3a   1151  9081.000	  1128  8900.000</p>
<p>   6    1276    13.156	  1276    13.156</p>
